  "title": "Get Saved Staffing Plan"
 },
 "description": "Restore a complete non-PII staffing plan created by plan_staffing or save_staffing_plan within the last 30 days. Use when a buyer starts a new conversation, changes agent platforms, or wants to continue a saved plan before requesting a quote. DO NOT guess or enumerate plan IDs; use only the 12-character plan_id the user, plan_staffing, or save_staffing_plan supplied. <examples>get_plan(plan_id='ABCDEFGH2345')</examples> <hints>A not-found result means the plan expired, storage was unavailable, or the ID is wrong; re-run plan_staffing. Review the restored plan with the user before request_quote.</hints>",
